        .grid-item.article.tnw
          a href="http://thenextweb.com/insider/2014/03/18/with-6-65m-in-its-pocket-nitrous-io-is-set-to-help-more-developers-save-time-and-effort/" target="_blank"
            span.date March 18, 2014
            h3 With $6.65m in its pocket, Nitrous is set to help more developers save time and effort

        .grid-item.article.techinasia
          a href="http://www.techinasia.com/nitrousio-raises-67-million-unchain-developers-laptops/" target="_blank"
